# The round-5 beeper, fixed: sensitivity tagged (L-11), one express clause,
# explicit refuses kept as documentation (L-14 info — redundant, legal).
contract yard-beeper "The co-op's beeper: alarm.attention only; everything else is refused by default — and twice, for the humans."

use apiary as apiary
use ui-intents as ui

intent alarm.attention @sensitivity = ui:high

express alarm.attention -> apiary:inspection
refuse series.window
refuse value.latest
